      "settings": {
        "title": "K-001",
        "description": "<p>The WALLHACK M-001 is a premium wireless gaming mouse built around a die-cast magnesium alloy shell. Its wireless receiver doubles as a charging dock and control interface, and a hot-swappable battery system means the mouse never has to stop for charging.</p>",
