      }
    },
    "text_9": {
      "type": "wh-text",
      "settings": {
        "columns": "2",
        "show_heading": true,
        "heading": "form and function",
        "body": "<p>The underside of the keyboard features 4 mounting holes for attaching a 4-degree or a 7-degree riser made from a solid block of machined aluminium. To mount it, simply screw the preferred riser on using the included screws and custom screwdriver.</p>",
        "body_1": "<p>The K-001 is our first keyboard, built for competitive gaming and made to last. Every part is chosen for how it performs and how it holds up.</p>",
        "body_2": "<p>The housing of the K-001 is made from CNC machined 6063 aluminium, that has been bead blasted and anodized for a smooth and durable finish.</p>",
        "color_scheme": "dark",
        "custom_background": "#0e0e0e"
      }
    },
