    "text_media_17": {
      "type": "wh-text-media",
      "settings": {
        "no_space_top": false,
        "no_space_bottom": false,
        "show_heading": true,
        "heading": "the stack",
        "body": "<p>The K-001 has a black anodized aluminum plate and dampening silicone mid layer. Underneath the PCB lays a layer of foam along with a sheet of plastic film that in combination with the silicone mid layer absorbs reverberation in the chassis.</p><p>The whole stack is screw-mounted to the bottom housing of the keyboard to ensure predictable actuation of each key and a crisp and clacky sound signature.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/wh-camp-7dbd311e.png",
        "image_mobile": "shopify://shop_images/wh-camp-5e88e6fb.png",
        "image_fade": "none",
        "image_fade_mobile": "none",
        "image_background": "none",
        "image_mobile_shape": "4:5",
        "image_fit": "fit",
        "image_fit_mobile": "same",
        "color_scheme": "dark",
        "spacing": "large",
        "image_shape": "21:9",
        "custom_background": "#0e0e0e"
      }
    },
    "text_media_18": {
      "type": "wh-text-media",
      "settings": {
        "no_space_top": true,
        "no_space_bottom": true,
        "show_heading": false,
        "heading": "Spill it, wipe it, keep playing",
        "body": "<p>At the bottom of the stack is our main electronics platform, the WALLHACK Core-MK1.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/wh-camp-06cf4d60.png",
        "image_mobile": "shopify://shop_images/wh-camp-286ad1d6.png",
        "image_fade": "none",
        "image_fade_mobile": "none",
        "image_background": "none",
        "image_mobile_shape": "21:9",
        "image_fit": "fit",
        "image_fit_mobile": "same",
        "color_scheme": "dark",
        "spacing": "large",
        "image_shape": "21:9",
        "custom_background": "#0e0e0e"
      }
    },
    "text_19": {
      "type": "wh-text",
      "settings": {
        "columns": "1",
        "show_heading": false,
        "heading": "form and function",
        "body": "<p>It achieves an 8000 hertz polling rate, 16000 hertz Scan rate and 0.129ms of input delay.</p><p>In combination, this will result in a seamless input that feels responsive and instantaneous in game. This tech stack also drives our implementation of input determination features such as custom actuation points, rapid trigger, game pad emulation and various types of SOCD.</p>",
        "body_1": "<p>The K-001 is our first keyboard, built for competitive gaming and made to last. Every part is chosen for how it performs and how it holds up.</p>",
        "body_2": "<p>The housing of the K-001 is made from CNC machined 6063 aluminium, that has been bead blasted and anodized for a smooth and durable finish.</p>",
        "color_scheme": "dark",
        "custom_background": "#0e0e0e"
      }
    },
    "text_20": {
      "type": "wh-text",
      "settings": {
        "columns": "1",
        "show_heading": true,
        "heading": "WALLHACK TERMINAL",
        "body": "<p>The K-001 features our web-based software, WALLHACK Terminal, to enable fine control of the keyboards internal settings without the need to download any software.<br><br>Here you can set up configure all setting of the keyboard such as game pad emulation, Depth-based or last-input SOCD, as well as the actuation point and rapid trigger settings, and a whole bunch of other tweaks to tailor the K-001 to your exact playstyle.</p>",
        "body_1": "<p>The K-001 is our first keyboard, built for competitive gaming and made to last. Every part is chosen for how it performs and how it holds up.</p>",
        "body_2": "<p>The housing of the K-001 is made from CNC machined 6063 aluminium, that has been bead blasted and anodized for a smooth and durable finish.</p>",
        "color_scheme": "dark",
        "custom_background": "#0e0e0e"
      }
    },
